==Battleground==
*3 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 30~36.67 seconds<sup>900f~1,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Chickful A]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Boraphim]] spawns as the boss.
**12 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**1 [[Chickful A]] spawns.
**1 [[Professor A.]] spawns.

==Strategy==
==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
Any [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber]] with a [[Special Abilities|special ability]] against [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] enemies that can outrange, or reach Professor A. through [[Long Distance]] or [[Omni Strike]] will be useful here, along with any Uber with a special ability against [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] enemies.
*[[Empress Chronos (Uber Rare Cat)|Empress Chronos]]: [[Freeze|Freezes]] all the enemies here to a halt, while also being able to reach Professor A. with her Long Distance, but can get hit by Professor A. when Boraphim is knocked back.
*[[Catman (Uber Rare Cat)|Dark Catman]]: Can deal great nuke damage to Boraphim.
*[[Mami Tomoe (Uber Rare Cat)|Mami Tomoe]]: 475 standing range along with [[Massive Damage|massive damage]] against Angel enemies makes a good fit for this stage.
*[[EVA Unit-02 (Uber Rare Cat)|EVA Unit-02]]: Can reach Professor A. with his anti-Red, Long Distance, massive damage strikes. Works much better in [[True Form]], but still works in other forms.

